/E (Reason 1- BIP110 filters are only temporary. After a year of activation, BIP110-coin will be exactly like Bitcoin again for better or worse, except that BIP110-coin will be worth nothing or very little, and be incompatible with Bitcoin as a result of its own self-inflicted fork. Although the changes that BIP110 claims to do are temporary, the fork is permanent. This temporary implementation of the filters makes the permanent hard-fork pointless.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
